	 + how to add a bank account{weight=1000}
	 - Well, it&#039;s pretty simple. You need to open the menu from top right corner of the screen 😊 <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "Go to Bank Account and tap on &quot;Add New Bank&quot; button." "Now select the bank you want to link and proceed to set up UPI PIN." "Enter the &quot;last six digits&quot; of your Debit/ATM card number and &quot;Expiry Date&quot;." "And just enter the OTP to set your PIN and add your bank account successfully." "Can I have your email id so that I can share an instruction video for support? 😊"</call> {topic=510644843604420000}

	 + can i pay by phonepe{weight=1000}
	 - Choose the option you need help with 👇<call>displayresoptions "Web" "Android" "iPhone" </call>{topic=917165898761949200}

	 + i d like to set reset upi pin{weight=1000}
	 - Well, you need to first open the menu from top right corner of the screen and go to the &quot;Bank Accounts&quot; section 😊 <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "You will see a &quot;SET&quot; option in case you have never set a UPI Pin for the bank account." "Otherwise you will see a &quot;RESET&quot; option to set a new UPI Pin for the bank account." "Enter the &quot;last six digits&quot; of your Debit/ATM card number and &quot;Expiry Date&quot;." "Enter the OTP and the new UPI Pin you want to set for the account and click submit." "Can I have your email id so that I can share an instruction video for support? 😊"</call> {topic=510644843604420000}
