> topic 917165898761949200

	 + web{weight=1000}
	 - On the web, you need to select &quot;Pay by PhonePe&quot; from the payment options and login to your account. 😊 <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "Choose the bank account and open PhonePe App in your smartphone." "You will see a collect request from merchant in notification section." "Tap pay to proceed for payment, enter your UPI PIN to complete your transaction." "Can I have your email id so that I can share an instruction video for support? 😊"</call> {topic=510644843604420000}

	 + android{weight=1000}
	 - On your smartphone, select &quot;Pay by PhonePe&quot; from the payment options and login to your account. 😊 <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "Now choose the bank account and enter your UPI PIN to complete the transaction." "Can I have your email id so that I can share an instruction video for support? 😊"</call> {topic=510644843604420000}

	 + iphone{weight=1000}
	 - On your iPhone, select &quot;Pay by PhonePe&quot; from the payment options and login to your account. 😊 <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "Choose the bank account and open PhonePe App." "You will see a collect request in the pending transaction screen, tap on pay." "Now enter your UPI PIN to complete the transaction." "Can I have your email id so that I can share an instruction video for support? 😊"</call> {topic=510644843604420000}
